  "label": "User projected onto the chicken as a metaphor for women",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the chicken visual material, which is being used as a metaphor for women in the meme. The text 'I like my women like i like my chickens' implies ownership and control, projecting the user's identity onto the chicken as a stand-in for women. The user is not explicitly addressed with 'you' or 'me', but the possessive 'my' and the metaphorical mapping imply the user is the one who holds the power and views women as property, projecting this self-image onto the chicken.",
